am/apps/2078230/ss_b39d31b63f2025547bd09d12c5f5550adb8222c2.1920x1080.jpg?t=1744026753","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078230/ss_b39d31b63f2025547bd09d12c5f5550adb8222c2.600x338.jpg?t=1744026753"},{"id":10,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078230/ss_2a3d45404941ef3655456138397e2a5ffd08a2cb.1920x1080.jpg?t=1744026753","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078230/ss_2a3d45404941ef3655456138397e2a5ffd08a2cb.600x338.jpg?t=1744026753"},{"id":11,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078230/ss_9e6f8dbdde427a3e8d1021b9c1450f1f05153b71.1920x1080.jpg?t=1744026753","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078230/ss_9e6f8dbdde427a3e8d1021b9c1450f1f05153b71.600x338.jpg?t=1744026753"}],"short_description":"Create, customize and command your battle wagon to conquer crazed enemy factions and save innocent survivors scattered throughout the lawless Badlands in the aftermath of a devastating apocalypse. Do you have what it takes to Build, Evolve and Fight to survive?","steam_appid":2078230,"support_info":{"email":"support@curvegames.com","url":"https://curvegames.com/contact/"},"supported_languages":"English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese","type":"game","website":"https://curvegames.com/our-games/"}